---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config/site";

const effectiveDate = "July 24, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn how EG Remodeling Experts collects, uses, and protects information submitted through its website and consultation form."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="display">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Effective {effectiveDate}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <article class="legal-copy container">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how {siteConfig.name} (“we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, and
        discloses personal information when you visit <a href={siteConfig.siteUrl}
          >{siteConfig.siteUrl.replace("https://", "")}</a
        >, request a consultation, or otherwise contact us.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information you choose to provide by phone, email, or through our consultation
        form. This may include your name, phone number, email address, project location, requested
        services, project description, preferred timeline, estimated budget, contact preferences,
        referral source, and any other information you include in your message.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our website and service providers may also process limited technical information necessary
        to deliver and secure the site, such as your IP address, browser or device type, requested
        pages, and access times. We do not use our own analytics platform or advertising trackers on
        this website.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We may use personal information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and consultation requests;</li>
        <li>Discuss, evaluate, schedule, and provide remodeling services;</li>
        <li>Prepare estimates and maintain customer and project records;</li>
        <li>Operate, protect, and improve our website and business;</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud, misuse, or security incidents; and</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable law and enforce our agreements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we disclose information</h2>
      <p>
        We may disclose personal information to service providers that help us operate the website,
        receive form submissions, communicate with customers, or conduct our business. These
        providers may include Google, which hosts our consultation form and related company
        services, and GitHub, which hosts this website.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may also disclose information when reasonably necessary to comply with law, protect
        rights or safety, investigate misuse, obtain professional advice, or complete a business
        transaction such as a reorganization or transfer of assets. We do not sell personal
        information, and we do not process personal information from this website for targeted
        advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Forms</h2>
      <p>
        Our consultation form is provided through Google Forms. Information you submit through the
        form is transmitted to and stored using Google services. Google may process technical
        information in accordance with its own <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a
        >. You may contact us by phone or email instead of using the form.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We do not place our own analytics or advertising cookies on this website. Embedded or linked
        third-party services, including Google Forms, may use cookies or similar technologies under
        their own policies and settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain personal information for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes
        described in this policy, including responding to requests, maintaining business and project
        records, resolving disputes, and meeting legal, accounting, or contractual obligations.
        Retention periods may vary depending on the nature of the information and our relationship
        with you.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable administrative and technical measures intended to protect personal
        information. However, no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we
        cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Your privacy choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may contact us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information
        you have provided. Depending on applicable law, you may have additional privacy rights. We
        may need to verify your request and may retain information where permitted or required by
        law.
      </p>

      <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for adults seeking remodeling services and is not directed to
        children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        The website may link to services we do not control, such as Instagram or Google. Their
        privacy practices are governed by their own policies, and we encourage you to review those
        policies before providing information.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy to reflect changes to our website, services, or legal obligations.
        The effective date at the top of this page indicates when the policy was last updated.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        To ask a privacy question or submit a privacy request, contact {siteConfig.name} at <a
          href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a
        > or <a href={siteConfig.phoneHref}>{siteConfig.phoneDisplay}</a>. We are located in {
          siteConfig.location
        }.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: white;
  }

  .legal-hero p {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .legal-copy {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  p,
  li {
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
  }

  p a,
  li a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-bronze);
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }
</style>
